<section class="py-14 sm:py-20 md:py-24 bg-surface px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Historias reales de la comunidad Trayko</h2>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium">Pasajeros y conductores que ya comparten viajes por distintas rutas de Colombia.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
            <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-high p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-primary-container">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Viaje de Bogota a Villa de Leyva pagando mucho menos y con total tranquilidad. La coordinacion fue muy facil desde la app."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest"></div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-bold text-primary">Valentina R.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-outline">Pasajera frecuente</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-high p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-primary-container">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Como conductor, Trayko me ayuda a recuperar parte de gasolina y peajes en rutas largas. Asi aprovecho mejor cada viaje."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest"></div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-bold text-primary">Sebastian M.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-outline">Conductor verificado</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
            <div class="bg-surface-container-high p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-primary-container">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined fill-1" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Me senti segura desde el primer trayecto. Poder revisar reseñas y verificaciones me ayudo a elegir mejor con quien viajar."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest"></div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-bold text-primary">Camila L.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-outline">Viajera verificada</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
